    "body": "```\nSELECT COUNT(*) as num, REGEXP_EXTRACT(body, r'(\\.toDataURL\\([^\\),]+,[^\\)]+\\))') AS match\nFROM [httparchive:runs.2014_08_15_requests_body]\nGROUP BY match\nORDER BY num DESC\n```\n\n[results-20160104-145315.csv.zip](https://github.com/whatwg/html/files/77244/results-20160104-145315.csv.zip)\n\nFirst page of results\n\n| Row | num | match |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | 5860657 | null |\n| 2 | 116 | .toDataURL(\"image/jpeg\",t/100) |\n| 3 | 61 | .toDataURL(c,d) |\n| 4 | 57 | .toDataURL(n,p.quality/100) |\n| 5 | 45 | .toDataURL(q,s.quality/100) |\n| 6 | 16 | .toDataURL(a,b) |\n| 7 | 13 | .toDataURL(\"image/jpeg\",n) |\n| 8 | 11 | .toDataURL(d,b.quality/100) |\n| 9 | 11 | .toDataURL(f,b.quality||.8) |\n| 10 | 11 | .toDataURL(\"image/jpeg\",b/100) |\n| 11 | 9 | .toDataURL(n,o) |\n| 12 | 9 | .toDataURL(n,r) |\n| 13 | 8 | .toDataURL(i,n) |\n| 14 | 8 | .toDataURL(i,n.quality/100) |\n| 15 | 8 | .toDataURL(n,i) |\n| 16 | 7 | .toDataURL(e,c.quality/100) |\n| 17 | 7 | .toDataURL(\"image/jpeg\",c/100) |\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
