    "created_at": "2016-01-04T14:16:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-01-04T14:16:16Z",
    "body": "I don't understand what problem this issue is trying to solve. The second argument is defined for `image/jpeg` and for other formats the additional arguments end up being ignored. This is not different from passing too many arguments to other methods.\n",
