    "updated_at": "2016-01-26T09:01:19Z",
    "body": "Do we have any reason to think that there will ever be another interpretation of the toDataURL second argument? Any reason to not simplify this by making the signature `DOMString toDataURL(optional DOMString type, optional double quality)` instead?\n",
